  "notes": "<p>This show was night five&nbsp;of Phish&#39;s Baker&#39;s Dozen run at Madison Square Garden and consisted of a powdered donut theme.&nbsp;Powdered sugar donuts were&nbsp;given to fans arriving at the venue and the show featured the Phish debuts of White Winter Hymnal and Powderfinger. Wilson and My Soul were&nbsp;teased before Cars Trucks Buses.&nbsp;Pebbles and Marbles was played for the first time since August 3, 2014 (106 shows). 1999 was played for the first time since December 31, 1998 (524&nbsp;shows), its jam exceeded ten minutes, and&nbsp;Fishman teased Mr. Completely in it.</p>",
